    "text": "By Kathy Hilt ,\n9 hours ago It’s time once again to sit back, relax and enjoy the peacefulness of along the Altamaha River. Ok, so maybe your schedule won’t allow you to actually to go the riverbanks and do that, but you can enjoy the experience again this year at the folklife play “Tales from the Altamaha” at the Blue Marquee in Lyons. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
